### 1. 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": "저 가입하고 싶은데 질문 몇 개 드려도 되나요?"
}

### 1.1 댓글 등록 - 유효성 검증 실패 (content가 비어 있음)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": ""
}

### 2. 내가 작성한 댓글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/comments/my?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### 3. 해당 게시글에 작성된 댓글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/1/comments?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### 4. 댓글 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": "댓글 내용을 수정합니다."
}

### 4.1 댓글 수정 - 유효성 검증 실패 (content가 비어 있음)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": ""
}

### 5. 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/comments/1
Authorization: {{accessToken}}
